<%= if (@revision_count || 0) > 0 do %>Draft revision <%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(@revision_count, 8) %> is ready.<% else %>The article draft is ready for review.<% end %>

Title: <%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(@title, 160) %>
Sources used:
<%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(@sources, 4_000) %>

--- DRAFT MARKDOWN ---
<%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(@body, 60_000) %>
--- END DRAFT ---

Nothing has been written to Git yet.

- Reply `confirm` to save this exact Markdown as a Git draft.
- Reply `modify: ...` with the changes you want; I will show a new revision.
- Reply `cancel` to discard the preview without writing anything.
